members.member:

Gets whether the Field will break a signature when its data is changed.

/// 
true if the Field breaks a signature on data change; otherwise, false.

member.example:
    The following examples show how to use this attribute.

[CRFControlPluginSupportedTypes("Image")]
class MyCRFImage : CRFControl, ICRFControlPlugin{
}


[CRFControlPluginSupportedTypes("Image", "Picture", "Bitmap")]
class MyCRFImage : CRFControl, ICRFControlPlugin{
}

    This sample shows the least code requiements to create a dynamic CRF control class.

[Export(typeof(ICRFControlPlugin))]
[PartCreationPolicy(CreationPolicy.NonShared)]
[CRFControlPluginSupportedTypes("Image")]
class MyCRFImage : CRFControl, ICRFControlPlugin{
    //Your codes
}
